      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Reorder the letters to make complete words. The first letters are underlined.</strong></p>\n<p>Anna: Hi, Tom! I heard there's a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>11.1</label><input id='fbo-903922-0' class='ms fillblank-option-11' index='0' name='fbo-903922-0' type='text' size='12' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903922-0' /></span> (P-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">W</span>-K-O-S-R-O-H)</strong> in our town where you can learn to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>11.2</label><input id='fbo-903922-1' class='ms fillblank-option-11' index='1' name='fbo-903922-1' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903922-1' /></span> (K-A-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">M</span>-E) </strong>pottery. Have you tried it?</p>\n<p>Tom: Yes, I went last week! The artisan taught us how to use a traditional <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>11.3</label><input id='fbo-903922-2' class='ms fillblank-option-11' index='2' name='fbo-903922-2' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903922-2' /></span> (C-E-E-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">T</span>-H-Q-N-U-I)</strong> to shape the clay.</p>\n<p>Anna: That sounds fun! What kind of pottery did you make?</p>\n<p>Tom: I made a small bowl. It was hard at first, but the instructor helped me a lot.</p>\n<p>Anna: I&#8217;ve always wanted to try pottery! It sounds like a great way to learn about local traditions.</p>\n<p>Tom: You should join! There are always skilled artisans there to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>11.4</label><input id='fbo-903922-3' class='ms fillblank-option-11' index='3' name='fbo-903922-3' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-903922-3' /></span> (T-U-S-<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">I</span>-C-N-T-R)</strong> you. And it's also a great way to spend time in our community and create something beautiful.</p>",
