      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Read the following leaflet and choose the option that best fits each blank.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Join Our Local Volunteer Team: Help Make Our Community Better!</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Are you looking for a way to contribute to your community? We are a team of caring individuals inviting you to join our local volunteer program!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>&#127775; Why Volunteer?</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li>Help<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='0' name='fbo-903934-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-903934-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903934-0'></option><option value=\"observe\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-0-observe'>observe</option><option value=\"serve\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-0-serve'>serve</option><option value=\"reserve\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-0-reserve'>reserve</option><option value=\"preserve\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-0-preserve'>preserve</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;the beauty of our parks and green spaces by participating in clean-up activities.</li>\n<li><strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='1' name='fbo-903934-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-903934-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903934-1'></option><option value=\"Repair\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-1-Repair'>Repair</option><option value=\"Damage\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-1-Damage'>Damage</option><option value=\"Display\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-1-Display'>Display</option><option value=\"Improve\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-1-Improve'>Improve</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;the local environment through tree planting and waste reduction efforts.</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>&#128172; How to Get Involved: </strong>We welcome volunteers of all ages and skills! Whether you're experienced or just starting, you can help!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>&#128736; Activities Included:</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li>Create a welcoming atmosphere full of <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='2' name='fbo-903934-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-903934-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903934-2'></option><option value=\"shape\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-2-shape'>shape</option><option value=\"taste\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-2-taste'>taste</option><option value=\"care\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-2-care'>care</option><option value=\"fragrance\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-2-fragrance'>fragrance</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;of flowers by planting more in public spaces.</li>\n<li>Assist in enhancing the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='3' name='fbo-903934-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-903934-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-903934-3'></option><option value=\"speed\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-3-speed'>speed</option><option value=\"system\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-3-system'>system</option><option value=\"function\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-3-function'>function</option><option value=\"action\" data-testid='fillblank-option-903934-3-action'>action</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;of our community centers through organizing events and activities.</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>&#127881;</strong> Ready to make a real impact? Sign up today and help us create a stronger, cleaner, and more connected community!</p>",
